@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #111111
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor LOGIC_COLOR_T1
title Read-only loan filter command
actor User
participant ":MainWindow" as UI
participant ":LogicManager" as Logic
participant ":AddressBookParser" as Parser
participant ":LoanListCommand" as Command
participant ":LoanPanel" as Panel

User -> UI: enter loans list nus/TEXT uuid/TEXT
activate UI
UI -> Logic: execute(text)
activate Logic
Logic -> Parser: parseCommand(text)
activate Parser
Parser --> Logic: command with LoanQuery
deactivate Parser
Logic -> Command: execute(model)
activate Command
Command --> Logic: CommandResult with DisplayRequest.loans(query)
deactivate Command
note right of Logic: isReadOnly() bypasses persistence
Logic --> UI: result
deactivate Logic
UI -> Panel: setQuery(query)
activate Panel
Panel -> Panel: refresh()
note right of Panel: Both fields now use the command criteria
Panel --> UI
deactivate Panel
UI --> User: filtered open and completed history
deactivate UI
note over UI, Panel
  Bare list has no query: preserve GUI filters.
  loans reset carries LoanQuery.all(): clear both fields.
  Direct GUI edits use the same matching predicate.
end note
@enduml
